⚡🇨🇦🇵🇸 “I will not stand in silence to what is happening”.

Ottawa mayoral candidate Neil Saravanamuttoo has pledged to raise the Palestinian flag at City Hall if elected, affirming that what is taking place in Gaza is a genocide that we must stop remaining silent about.

