⚡🇮🇷🇺🇸 The number of American casualties in the war with Iran has risen to 774, according to data from the U.S. Department of Defense. Around 18 deaths and 756 injuries.

Approximately 60 new injuries have been reported in recent days, from explosions in attacks targeting U.S. bases in the region.

